---
import { MIGRATE_PATH } from "../../lib/site-nav"
import RepairQueue from "../product/RepairQueue.astro"
import Section from "../site/Section.astro"
import Split from "../site/Split.astro"
import Stage from "../site/Stage.astro"
---

<Section>
  <Split>
    <div slot="start" class="statement">
      <h2 class="h2">Bring what you built.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Grafana dashboards come across with their folders, variables and links, and every old link keeps resolving.
        Elasticsearch and OpenSearch indices connect as they are, and the KQL you typed in Discover runs here. Panels the
        importer cannot match go to the repair queue, where the agent fixes a failing query when you ask.
      </p>
      <a href={MIGRATE_PATH} class="arrow">Migrate →</a>
    </div>
    <div slot="end" data-in-view="rise">
      <Stage><RepairQueue onStage /></Stage>
    </div>
  </Split>
</Section>

<style>
  .statement {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }
</style>
